  "columns": [
    {
      "page": 9,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 1,
      "quote": "王𢎞之字方平琅邪臨沂人宣訓衞尉鎮之弟也少孤",
      "sha256": "e24880d1a33820a913903fe293183e0c9ba5852a3950b74f701c47b2949c9d5a",
      "expanded_reading": "王弘之字方平琅邪臨沂人宣訓衞尉鎮之弟也少孤",
      "glyph_occurrences": [
        {
          "offset": 1,
          "printed_glyph": "𢎞",
          "expanded_glyph": "弘",
          "note": "原件缺右末點。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 2,
      "quote": "貧為外祖徵士何淮所撫育從叔獻之及太原王恭並",
      "sha256": "6b665601a0beb8367df0599449e9035df3a3bcb2b14a94a6fd9da2cdfcde57e0"
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 3,
      "quote": "貴重之晉安帝隆安中為琅邪王中軍參軍遷司徒主",
      "sha256": "f576c9b8329c74b64d1322a8c34dec8746834a984e26b8b3ddac52eeefff2a0f"
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 4,
      "quote": "簿家貧而性好山水求為烏程令尋以病歸桓𤣥輔晉",
      "sha256": "89e24d6f47a6653a4324961a92b4c2a7ccef34ecd9b439f4cad3974c8795a4ec",
      "expanded_reading": "簿家貧而性好山水求為烏程令尋以病歸桓玄輔晉",
      "glyph_occurrences": [
        {
          "offset": 18,
          "printed_glyph": "𤣥",
          "expanded_glyph": "玄",
          "note": "原件缺右末點。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 5,
      "quote": "桓謙以為衞軍參軍時琅邪殷仲文還姑孰祖送傾朝",
      "sha256": "eb996596925b5266ea89ac5861a668254388186b61c0d4f76019ff0dbd68ff4a"
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 6,
      "quote": "謙要𢎞之同行答曰凡祖離送別必在有情下官與殷",
      "sha256": "6423cf8f10e715293f7aa19c4b3067e5d621f3726658a787b4cbbf0ce66243ba",
      "expanded_reading": "謙要弘之同行答曰凡祖離送別必在有情下官與殷",
      "glyph_occurrences": [
        {
          "offset": 2,
          "printed_glyph": "𢎞",
          "expanded_glyph": "弘",
          "note": "原件缺右末點。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 7,
      "quote": "風馬不接無緣扈從謙貴其言每隨兄鎮之之安成郡",
      "sha256": "d51e185c839620c3ec4f7a7100fcb8bab4812bd26e54e762a4daa2e73c608e67"
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 8,
      "quote": "𢎞之解職同行荊州刺史桓偉請為南蠻長史義熙初",
      "sha256": "34636bec1b581572b5cc93fe4c9600a92a6858d9c06a6fb1e1a9a916e7fb4ec0",
      "expanded_reading": "弘之解職同行荊州刺史桓偉請為南蠻長史義熙初",
      "glyph_occurrences": [
        {
          "offset": 0,
          "printed_glyph": "𢎞",
          "expanded_glyph": "弘",
          "note": "原件缺右末點。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 9,
      "quote": "何無忌又請為右軍司馬高祖命為徐州治中從事史",
      "sha256": "c764570556744c04a8e1783d41a16178159dc67c9e0b159ae9cf70ecc8bc1eb7"
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 10,
      "quote": "除員外散騎常侍並不就家在會稽上虞從兄敬𢎞為",
      "sha256": "2f0b8d5e03522b42c57bd90804f027166a451a92ada10fe1979566dc982a38e2",
      "expanded_reading": "除員外散騎常侍並不就家在會稽上虞從兄敬弘為",
      "glyph_occurrences": [
        {
          "offset": 19,
          "printed_glyph": "𢎞",
          "expanded_glyph": "弘",
          "note": "原件缺右末點。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 1,
      "quote": "吏部尚書奏曰聖明司契載德惟新垂鑒仄微表揚隱",
      "sha256": "55ec7d6734e263b3db9d324b02a898fca22f8b9bff2d81f101221f4760c65bc5"
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 2,
      "quote": "介默語仰風荒遐傾首前員外散騎常侍琅邪王𢎞之",
      "sha256": "e79b63742faa085f1a06a5a1c644daf624831257c10867af8775b92f06af72d4",
      "expanded_reading": "介默語仰風荒遐傾首前員外散騎常侍琅邪王弘之",
      "glyph_occurrences": [
        {
          "offset": 19,
          "printed_glyph": "𢎞",
          "expanded_glyph": "弘",
          "note": "原件缺右末點。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 3,
      "quote": "恬漠丘園放心居逸前衞將軍參軍武昌郭希林素履",
      "sha256": "925914d037abf64b5490b72265026a77f166f0745bc153570ce6f9cd30ce983e"
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 4,
      "quote": "純潔嗣徽前武並擊壤聖朝未蒙表飾宜加旌聘賁于",
      "sha256": "c421e018c0b703ee7f6d5809b68fcbf3520aaa595dba379c0d3bbbf2763b5715"
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 5,
      "quote": "丘園以彰止遜之美以祛動求之累臣愚謂𢎞之可太",
      "sha256": "e296279ffaa2edacaccbdaee08409f36766e0de0da5881e2f554f21dabb8523d",
      "expanded_reading": "丘園以彰止遜之美以祛動求之累臣愚謂弘之可太",
      "glyph_occurrences": [
        {
          "offset": 17,
          "printed_glyph": "𢎞",
          "expanded_glyph": "弘",
          "note": "原件缺右末點。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 6,
      "quote": "子庶子希林可著作郎即徵𢎞之為庶子不就太祖即",
      "sha256": "64408fa23267d4a53cbfc1c5e62d84e93ae5e729db23c5d9ecdebe67376e3b73",
      "expanded_reading": "子庶子希林可著作郎即徵弘之為庶子不就太祖即",
      "glyph_occurrences": [
        {
          "offset": 11,
          "printed_glyph": "𢎞",
          "expanded_glyph": "弘",
          "note": "原件缺右末點。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 7,
      "quote": "位敬𢎞為左僕射又陳𢎞之高行表於初筮苦節彰於",
      "sha256": "dacb56021611e134becfff7fd027ae71baaf15c68426bcf8e207ec111bbcf0a9",
      "expanded_reading": "位敬弘為左僕射又陳弘之高行表於初筮苦節彰於",
      "glyph_occurrences": [
        {
          "offset": 2,
          "printed_glyph": "𢎞",
          "expanded_glyph": "弘",
          "note": "原件缺右末點。"
        },
        {
          "offset": 9,
          "printed_glyph": "𢎞",
          "expanded_glyph": "弘",
          "note": "原件缺右末點。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 8,
      "quote": "莫年今內外晏然當修太平之化宜招空谷以敦沖退",
      "sha256": "11f2807f1894cddfa23de13a5407b75e9a7d4123b7fafd2156bd5b9d599a673e"
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 9,
      "quote": "之美元嘉四年徵為通直散騎常侍又不就敬𢎞嘗解",
      "sha256": "938e4870c6a3f8aa2a344bee547d454447a863fc27a96023793a91e3d881efba",
      "expanded_reading": "之美元嘉四年徵為通直散騎常侍又不就敬弘嘗解",
      "glyph_occurrences": [
        {
          "offset": 18,
          "printed_glyph": "𢎞",
          "expanded_glyph": "弘",
          "note": "原件缺右末點。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 10,
      "quote": "貂裘與之即着以采藥性好釣上虞江有一處名三石",
      "sha256": "2f8832b8c540fc644f3ea396045491b4f0f1f5da1ee3672fad7ed463fa17110d"
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 1,
      "quote": "頭𢎞之常垂綸於此經過者不識之或問漁師得魚賣",
      "sha256": "517e3896e809807685d8992c0975ada5dbd319762a015f232f5290aacee8b71f",
      "expanded_reading": "頭弘之常垂綸於此經過者不識之或問漁師得魚賣",
      "glyph_occurrences": [
        {
          "offset": 1,
          "printed_glyph": "𢎞",
          "expanded_glyph": "弘",
          "note": "原件缺右末點。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 2,
      "quote": "不𢎞之曰亦自不得得亦不賣日夕載魚入上虞郭經",
      "sha256": "c6b3eede67d90a93f38eac96c55fb7d789d0e6185005d2e713d584f465b07f09",
      "expanded_reading": "不弘之曰亦自不得得亦不賣日夕載魚入上虞郭經",
      "glyph_occurrences": [
        {
          "offset": 1,
          "printed_glyph": "𢎞",
          "expanded_glyph": "弘",
          "note": "原件缺右末點。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 3,
      "quote": "親故門各以一兩頭置門內而去始寧汰川有佳山水",
      "sha256": "a19f0e42f8b5c5d88254b0ad51ce0c9363e9e021012b7f789c6632f491ef1aa4"
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 4,
      "quote": "𢎞之又依巖築室謝靈運顏延之並相欽重靈運與廬",
      "sha256": "25a258fb83509153e344e46a61e2fb50e052ebdac234c99f0fd4047e407d08d5",
      "expanded_reading": "弘之又依巖築室謝靈運顏延之並相欽重靈運與廬",
      "glyph_occurrences": [
        {
          "offset": 0,
          "printed_glyph": "𢎞",
          "expanded_glyph": "弘",
          "note": "原件缺右末點。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 5,
      "quote": "陵王義真牋曰會境既豐山水是以江左嘉遁並多居",
      "sha256": "f954fe1541b12f7319b78875acdbc2e91deed04e96dee99071b9a11b9a15a63a"
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 6,
      "quote": "之但季世慕榮幽棲者寡或復才為時求弗獲從志至",
      "sha256": "c4a91982df6ce9c35571b772612628f29f316e42c7404f2579d7cce62d61a053"
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 7,
      "quote": "若王𢎞之拂衣歸耕踰歷三紀孔淳之隱約窮岫自始",
      "sha256": "21776fa35a9bc62b2027c9be03c265596bc79fb86479cbaaf6f33d44d9e7f3ea",
      "expanded_reading": "若王弘之拂衣歸耕踰歷三紀孔淳之隱約窮岫自始",
      "glyph_occurrences": [
        {
          "offset": 2,
          "printed_glyph": "𢎞",
          "expanded_glyph": "弘",
          "note": "原件缺右末點。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 8,
      "quote": "迄今阮萬齡辭事就閒纂成先業浙河之外棲遲山澤",
      "sha256": "e66bec180f452bc2bb08dff9bc63bb17dc64527c918426ca9133c75c225886c0"
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 9,
      "quote": "如斯而已既遠同羲唐亦激貪厲競殿下愛素好古常",
      "sha256": "c1a587e167c4049556975e3fff6c0c635aaf3e0f2beb27b9ced3a6ecca07ee69"
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 10,
      "quote": "若布衣每憶昔聞虛想巖穴若遣一介有以相存真可",
      "sha256": "a1318c3980ef31ab4f78d82509e36ff76fb8e8c4052d72248f511d4909f7aefb"
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 1,
      "quote": "謂千載盛美也𢎞之四年卒時年六十三顏延之欲為",
      "sha256": "51e2524b610c5e6a6d8b8805a20f63ec80bd417e4f5c2d377b3b4a4f87afa892",
      "expanded_reading": "謂千載盛美也弘之四年卒時年六十三顏延之欲為",
      "glyph_occurrences": [
        {
          "offset": 6,
          "printed_glyph": "𢎞",
          "expanded_glyph": "弘",
          "note": "原件缺右末點。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 2,
      "quote": "作誄書與𢎞之子曇生曰君家高世之節有識歸重豫",
      "sha256": "8effcaedec78df94aa0eff5f9bb8b51ebf34338f96953188c73ee1ba24e461d4",
      "expanded_reading": "作誄書與弘之子曇生曰君家高世之節有識歸重豫",
      "glyph_occurrences": [
        {
          "offset": 4,
          "printed_glyph": "𢎞",
          "expanded_glyph": "弘",
          "note": "原件缺右末點。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 3,
      "quote": "染豪翰所應載述況僕託慕末風竊以敘德為事但恨",
      "sha256": "7286df5923e953054c048c72b84b9d33eb01cdf55b7fdf0c7504ccc1ada881c5"
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 4,
      "quote": "短筆不足書美誄竟不就曇生好文義以謙和見稱歷",
      "sha256": "3a5459420a20d6b21c5c18d46b84de17e1bf0d7921d1af62d93d41083489be7b"
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 5,
      "quote": "顯位吏部尚書太常卿大明末為吳興太守太宗初四",
      "sha256": "5b09669bba9adafbf91e14e1491e923ced8929876af796d070bfbb3c582e1928"
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 6,
      "quote": "方同逆戰敗奔會稽歸降被宥終於中散大夫",
      "sha256": "a0a509359db89163537751a2f5bd9c4f0a2399d9e4487243200d1eba784c6ea6"
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 7,
      "quote": "阮萬齡陳留尉氏人也祖思曠左光祿大夫父寧黃門",
      "sha256": "4f3e2ac0e953a5f62cb6f35f62fac67943648508d8829888b84e0d899c356588"
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 8,
      "quote": "侍郎萬齡少知名自通直郎為孟昶建威長史時袁豹",
      "sha256": "32b4845838e27f232189b92131cdb4f5c8e4dd5c5c75adb76f49514749c92f34"
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 9,
      "quote": "江夷相係為昶司馬時人謂昶府有三素望萬齡家在",
      "sha256": "d00498de6900d15c7071b380ad2d91f7fda7093e0691d1756ac9768e14cb6a3d"
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "leaf_side": "R",
      "column": 10,
      "quote": "會稽剡縣頗有素情永初末自侍中解職東歸徵為秘",
      "sha256": "495c0a3cce688d51b8f9a574f84e4d50aa12e10b415b4c29e0a267d612fa9a87"
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "leaf_side": "L",
      "column": 1,
